# Build outputs
# NOTE (Milady fork): dist/ IS committed in this fork because we patch dist/
# directly rather than running `tsc` (upstream peerDep is @elizaos/core@1.7.2,
# Milady's workspace ships @elizaos/core@2.0.0-alpha.* — a fresh tsc build
# fails on type-shape mismatches). Until the plugin is rebased on current
# core, dist/ is the canonical runtime artifact and ships with the source.
